      "statement": "cdc-badge-os assigns I2C0 to GPIO17/18 (charger 0x6A and expander 0x20), I2C1 to GPIO47/48 for expansion, shared SPI to GPIO12/11/13, e-paper CS/DC/RST/BUSY to GPIO41/45/46/42, TROPIC01 CS to GPIO10, SAO GPIOs to 15/16 and Grove to GPIO2/3.",
